{"id":"487cec3a88ade19b","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-game3-induced-play.md","title":"ZFC Game3 Induced Play","display":"df-zfc-game3-induced-play — ZFC Game3 Induced Play","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game3-induced-play","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game3-induced-play"],"display":"df-zfc-game3-induced-play — ZFC Game3 Induced Play","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game3-induced-play"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game3-induced-play</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game3-induced-play — ZFC Game3 Induced Play"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ddf53d1530db82ba\" href=\"?note=ddf53d1530db82ba\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,P,\\sigma,z,N\\in V\">\\(H,P,\\sigma,z,N\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3StrategyProfile}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame3StrategyProfile}_S\\)</span> (strategy-profile predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ddf53d1530db82ba\" href=\"?note=ddf53d1530db82ba\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame3InducedPlay}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame3InducedPlay}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}induced\\text{-}play} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame3InducedPlay}_S(H,P,\\sigma,z,N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcGame3StrategyProfile}_S(H,N,P,\\sigma)\\land z\\in H\\land\\neg\\exists a\\in V\\;(z^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in H)\\land\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(z)\\;\\bigl(z(n)=\\sigma(P(z{\\upharpoonright}n))(z{\\upharpoonright}n)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game3\\text{-}induced\\text{-}play} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame3InducedPlay}_S(H,P,\\sigma,z,N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcGame3StrategyProfile}_S(H,N,P,\\sigma)\\land z\\in H\\land\\neg\\exists a\\in V\\;(z^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in H)\\land\\forall n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(z)\\;\\bigl(z(n)=\\sigma(P(z{\\upharpoonright}n))(z{\\upharpoonright}n)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The play is now a terminal history generated by a valid strategy profile. The former <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Term}(H)\">\\(\\operatorname{Term}(H)\\)</span> came from term syntax and had no game-theoretic meaning.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile.md","status":"resolved","id":"ddf53d1530db82ba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-game3-strategy-profile.md]]","embed":false},{"ta